{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5e8b2bf2e075f6cc","name":"UT-AT","source":{"id":"source:reference-5e8b2bf2e075f6cc","title":"UT-AT","revision":20084,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:10:31Z","sha256":"4338ec74c635e2798e5a05eb6efed283ad4161ec31f098604375aed8db6d095d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20084","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=UT-AT&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5e8b2bf2e075f6cc","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Notoriously slow and vulnerable, the Unstable Terrain Artillery Transport, or UT-AT- known by the troops as the \"Trident\" because of its weapon configuration- is a heavy repulsorlift tank built by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kuat Drive Yards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kuat_Drive_Yards?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mekuun Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mekuun_Corporation?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to make up for the design shortfalls of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walkers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walkers","referenceId":"reference:552672704065a9f2"}," such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["AT-TE"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AT-TE","referenceId":"reference:2352689c50817bbd"},". Equipped with banks of repulsorlift \"skis\" that redistribute the UT-AT's weight based on the terrain, the UT-AT is ungainly in combat and requires an additional full round of ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Out Movement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Out_Movement","referenceId":"reference:c3e269326f94373b"}," to reach its top speed of 45 kilometers per hour. However, the repulsorlifts can be reconfigured for traction (rather than repulsion), allowing the UT-AT to scale sheer surfaces.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The UT-AT's Bomblet Generator allows the pilot to shunt some of the reactor engine's energy to an ion converter, unleashing virtual storms of ion \"grenades\" with the range of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:da6a8268b875d982"},". However, diverting the energy to the Bomblet Generator drains a great deal of energy; the UT-AT must come to a complete stop for a full round before firing the Ion Bomblets.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The interior of the UT-AT can be configured either for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Troopers"}," (half a Platoon) or materiel, such as bridge-laying equipment.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Expert)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["UT-AT Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 10 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 8), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 19; +10 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","chi